  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.93,
      "end_seconds": 4.92,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "morning, doctor is this the right room?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.45,
      "end_seconds": 9.65,
      "duration_seconds": 4.2,
      "text": "No problem at all, come in. What's troubling you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 10.96,
      "end_seconds": 15.08,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "well, I've been having a bit tired sometimes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 16.53,
      "end_seconds": 19.79,
      "duration_seconds": 3.26,
      "text": "okay has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.41,
      "end_seconds": 31.31,
      "duration_seconds": 9.9,
      "text": "I'm not sure when it began to to be honest some weeks ago but I can't say how many"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 31.82,
      "end_seconds": 34.86,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Is it bearing on you a lot?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 36.41,
      "end_seconds": 41.75,
      "duration_seconds": 5.34,
      "text": "I, I'd give it a four, out of ten"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.64,
      "end_seconds": 46.29,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 47.69,
      "end_seconds": 58.72,
      "duration_seconds": 11.03,
      "text": "Brittle nails goes along with it, most of the time. And being vegetarian, too. The Brittle nails? That's been for four weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 77.37,
      "end_seconds": 80.53,
      "duration_seconds": 3.16,
      "text": "any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 81.77,
      "end_seconds": 101.12,
      "duration_seconds": 19.35,
      "text": "I have asthma, for nearly five years i've never really been one for hospitals i looked a few things up online, and and that probably didn't help i have gout, for about ten years. High blood pressure, for nearly five years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.45,
      "end_seconds": 105.85,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "right right have you been to theatre before?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.4,
      "end_seconds": 120.49,
      "duration_seconds": 9.09,
      "text": "Let me think, yes, I had a mole taken off my arm, a few years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.3,
      "end_seconds": 140.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "does your family have any medical conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.7,
      "end_seconds": 147.59,
      "duration_seconds": 5.89,
      "text": "my daughter has type 1 diabetes my aunt has rheumatoid arthritis"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 148.76,
      "end_seconds": 152.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.84,
      "text": "do you take any prescribed or over-the-counter medicines?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 153.31,
      "end_seconds": 167.95,
      "duration_seconds": 14.64,
      "text": "Oh, I'm on Foracort inhaler, twice a day. I take metoprolol, 50 milligrams, twice a day for my pressure. Let me think, I used to take ramipril, but I stopped it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.5,
      "end_seconds": 171.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "Have you got any known allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 173.34,
      "end_seconds": 184.69,
      "duration_seconds": 11.35,
      "text": "I think I reacted to to some antibiotic once, years ago. I don't remember which one, or what happened exactly"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 189.27,
      "end_seconds": 190.69,
      "duration_seconds": 1.42,
      "text": "do you smoke?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 192.79,
      "end_seconds": 197.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.43,
      "text": "I smoke roughly a pack every two days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 198.28,
      "end_seconds": 200.15,
      "duration_seconds": 1.87,
      "text": "Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.02,
      "end_seconds": 203.75,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Nothing, I'm teetotal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.88,
      "end_seconds": 206.53,
      "duration_seconds": 1.65,
      "text": "how are your meals?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.5,
      "end_seconds": 212.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "I grab fast food at lunch most days"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 214.27,
      "end_seconds": 218.01,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "okay are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 218.65,
      "end_seconds": 221.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.72,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 222.93,
      "end_seconds": 226.74,
      "duration_seconds": 3.81,
      "text": "Right, what line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.33,
      "end_seconds": 233.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.43,
      "end_seconds": 236.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "right, how about black stools?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 238.38,
      "end_seconds": 240.31,
      "duration_seconds": 1.93,
      "text": "nope, no black stools"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 241.2,
      "end_seconds": 246.81,
      "duration_seconds": 5.61,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any breathlessness, dizziness or heavy periods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.54,
      "end_seconds": 251.54,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "No, I haven't had any of them."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 252.58,
      "end_seconds": 254.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.29,
      "text": "Is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 255.77,
      "end_seconds": 257.25,
      "duration_seconds": 1.48,
      "text": "no, nothing there"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 258.02,
      "end_seconds": 260.66,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "let me quickly check your readings"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.42,
      "end_seconds": 275.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.95,
      "text": "nearly done with the readings.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 294.52,
      "end_seconds": 302.59,
      "duration_seconds": 8.07,
      "text": "okay: heart rate 81 temp 36.4 degrees pressure 110 over 82 oxygen saturation is 97 percent"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 304.1,
      "end_seconds": 306.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.21,
      "text": "is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 307.91,
      "end_seconds": 311.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.61,
      "text": "I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 313.2,
      "end_seconds": 317.22,
      "duration_seconds": 4.02,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 318.35,
      "end_seconds": 321.08,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "I'll listen to your chest now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 331.54,
      "end_seconds": 337.51,
      "duration_seconds": 5.97,
      "text": "your pulse and blood pressure are normal and the the eyelids are a good colour"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.43,
      "end_seconds": 353.83,
      "duration_seconds": 10.4,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit up now. Right, here's what I'm thinking. I'd lean towards mildly low iron stores risk from diet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 354.86,
      "end_seconds": 356.92,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 358.89,
      "end_seconds": 369.29,
      "duration_seconds": 10.4,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's mildly low iron stores risk from diet, and we'll watch how it goes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 381.03,
      "end_seconds": 388.01,
      "duration_seconds": 6.98,
      "text": "eat pulses, leafy greens and vitamin-C rich foods with meals does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 388.82,
      "end_seconds": 393.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.15,
      "text": "Erm, you know, okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 398.61,
      "end_seconds": 399.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.32,
      "text": "All the best."
    }
  ]
